Starting kafka:
   in archive/software/kafka start:
       ./start_kafka
       ./start_kafka_connect

Trade service:
    services/ao/trade_service.py

Market script is:
    services/ao/ao_market_service.py - to start the market service for ao.

The API script is: trade_api.py, single threaded can be spawned as:
   python3 services/ao/trade_api.py

Deploying trade_api.py in multithreading:
gunicorn -w 8 trade_api:application 

(application is the flask application to be launched).
Gunnicorn launches on a different port. 


Start the controller in the rt_server folder.
    RUST_LOG=info cargo r > /tmp/ao 2>&1   # this will log messages & errors into /tmp/ao


Kafka topics as follows:

    Kafka server is by default on localhost:9092

   - kafka folder: ~/archive/software/kafka/kafka-3.4.0-src/bin/
   - list topics: ./kafka-topics.sh --list --boostrap-server localhost:9092
   - list content on topic: ./kafka-console-consumer 
   
   -air_options.ao.mkt_events  - market events
       sample events: {"UA160|20170501": 200.0, "UA150|20170501": 150.0, "UA155|20170501": 150.0}

   - air_options.ao.results - results 
